 "about": "The titles the great beings hold (src/people/9999976-titles, D-183; moved here from data/legends.json and data/power.json so every title is one kind of data). A legend or a master names its titles by id; A.POWER reads each as it always did: buffs (capabilities, level, power) and honour, so the legends balance (D-176, D-177) is exactly what it was; when orders 92 and 93 stretched the scale (every legend's level x 1000/800 on a new curve, D-185), each legend's signature title took the power that gives back the ratios between the legends that D-177 set, so every matchup is still what it was (docs/design/powers.md, the stretch). weight X stands above SSS: these titles carry no person effects, only the beings buffs, except the Sword Saint, who is both a title and a class a person may one day earn when the old Saint is gone. born: held from birth (a Primordial Archdemon is born one). unique: one living holder.",
